  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DHI Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spectator Video Technology Holding B.V. will perform feasibility study in cooperation with Sagam Community Hospital regarding the implementation of the Spectator eHealth &amp; Telecare Communication Platform. Sagam is interested in TeleHealth solutions because of the rural area they are working in. As a consequence, Sagam is looking for solutions to make their services more efficient. Objectives are:1.	Improve Healthcare access in remote areas, e.g. for diabetic patients in the rural areas;2.	Improve access to validated medical information for patients, care givers and community workers;3.	Improve Health awareness of the population; behaviour change and Preventive Care.The goal of this grant: The goal of this feasibility study is convincing SAGAM about the possibilities and added value of the Spectator eHealth &amp; Telecare Communication Platform.</narrative>
  </description>
